| ------------- | ------------ |
| Int8          | `sbyte`      |
| UInt8         | `byte`       |
| Int16         | `short`      |
| UInt16        | `ushort`     |
| Int32         | `int`        |
| UInt32        | `uint`       |
| Int64         | `long`       |
| UInt64        | `ulong`      |
| Int128        | `BigInteger` |
| UInt128       | `BigInteger` |
| Int256        | `BigInteger` |
| UInt256       | `BigInteger` |

***

