| UInt8         | ❌     | SMALLINT     | java.lang.Short      | SMALLINT     | com.clickhouse.data.value.UnsignedByte    |
| UInt16        | ❌     | INTEGER      | java.lang.Integer    | INTEGER      | com.clickhouse.data.value.UnsignedShort   |
